  "limitations": [
    "Checks ran on the exact delivery APK in the owned Android emulator. Physical-handset GPU/FPS and audio were not newly verified.",
    "The maximum-facility case reuses a disclosed complete native save with added completed facilities. Actual native selection/layout is checked; this does not claim ordinary construction of all added facilities.",
    "Normal-cost production, waiting FIFO and clearing waiting work are checked separately on an unmodified native setup. Source tests and screenshots alone are not production proof.",
    "The existing software-emulator black-terrain limitation remains. All Towers/Duel program, WASM, data, maps, scenarios and Android source bytes are frozen to 0.12.",
    "No full 30-wave victory, new Duel balancing campaign or unrelated automatic truck-picker repair was performed for this Factory/navigation/guide update.",
    "Earlier long unprotected fixture attempt failed after normal/compact and wide family checks. It remains failed diagnostic evidence, not a passing run.",
    "Earlier exact-APK navigation run passed BASE, all three Help/real-pan cycles and footer status. It stopped before any world tap because the QA camera fixture assumed an inverted radar mapping. These passing raw records are retained verbatim; only world taps, Factory Back and optional confirmation are tested in a separate restored native epoch.",
    "Every available ordinary native recipe already had a saved phone alias. The actual saved-state menu, library, hardware deduplication and unchanged phone bytes were checked; adding a new phone alias from this Factory menu was not newly exercised.",
    "The QA paragraph selector could match an earlier Help paragraph. Final guide evidence uses the recorded actual final-section bounds at maximum body scroll and manually reviewed bottom screenshots; this is an evidence-selector correction, not a game change.",
    "The first long maximum-fixture run lost the Lab Activity after its final Back check; precise cause was not conclusively captured. Complete normal/compact/wide rerun with fresh native fixture before each profile passed, including all Back paths.",
    "Camera setup and missed short ADB swipe attempts remain failed diagnostics. Continuation of already passed navigation sections is explicitly linked to its source report; no uninterrupted-journey or game-fix claim is made for those test corrections.",
    "Software-emulator black terrain limits ground appearance review. Physical handset performance, audio and a full 30-wave victory are not newly certified."
