  "fixtureDisclosures": [
    {
      "path": "qa/test-13/final-max/max.json",
      "seeded": true,
      "disclosure": "A separate complete genuine Iron Valley save is used as a QA fixture. Completed facilities are copied from genuine native records to validated free, reachable native sites until there are5labs,5vehiclefactories and5cyborgfactories. Only struct.json and the object allocator in gam.json are seeded; game.map, terrain, research, components, power, native limits, rules and queues are retained. Subsequent research/production are real UI actions using ordinary costs/times. This does not claim the extra facilities were constructed normally. This run restores the exact complete existing native save before each profile, without regenerating facilities. Already-observed genuine initial production completions are saved before the next full restore; the clock/playing state is checked before each Back action."
    }
